[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぐ……ここは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... Where am I...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やーっと起きた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Finally awake, are we?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アイラか。他の奴らは？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla? What about the others?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "残念でしたー。気が付いた時、近くにいたのは\nあんただけ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No such luck. When I came to, you were the only one around."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "チッ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Tch."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "舌打ちしたいのはお互い様だっての。\nそれより、ここがどこかを調べなきゃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, I'm just as annoyed as you are. More importantly, we need to figure out where we are."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "言われるまでもねぇな……うっ。\nこのへん、マナが充満してんのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No need to say that again... Ugh. The mana concentration here is intense."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いきなり立ち上がるからー。\nそう。どうにか動けそうな濃度だけどね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's what happens when you try to stand up too quickly. But yeah, it's just barely manageable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "災難続きだな。しかもなんだ、この青い霧は。\n気味が悪い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "One disaster after another. And what's with this blue mist? Gives me the creeps."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "焚き火の跡だ。誰かいたのかな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Look, campfire remains. Someone must have been here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "待てよ。そこの地面……何だこりゃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold on. The ground here... What in the world?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "爆弾でも使った？\nけど、中心部は綺麗なものだし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Was there an explosion? But the center is so clean..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "人間の仕業じゃないのかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe this wasn't done by humans?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さぁな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who knows."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん？\u3000見たことない光沢の石だな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm? Never seen a stone with this kind of luster before."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ッ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ngh!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どしたの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's wrong!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや……マナの濃度が高かったんだろうよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Nothing... It must be the mana."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何だ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What the!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今の声、なに！？\u3000……ま、魔物！？\u3000",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What was that sound!? M-monsters!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まだまだいる！\u3000やるしかないっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There's more coming! We've got no choice but to fight!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アラディス調査団の一員で、勘定高い手練れの冒険者。\n自分なりの美学を持ち、他人には縛られず生きている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rutger Arendt - A member of the Aladiss Research Team and a seasoned adventurer who loves valuable items."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ルトガー・アーレント",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "System"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アラディス調査団の一員で、ヴィクトルの妹。\n調査活動中もおしゃれを忘れない乙女心を持つ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Isla von Duerer - A member of the Aladiss Research Team and Viktor's younger sister. Even during investigations, she never forgets her feminine charm."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アイラ・フォン・デューラー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "System"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]